{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/biology-topic-excretion-systems/","source":"students/subjects/biology/biology-topic-excretion-systems.html","area":"students","kind":"division","title":"Excretory Systems - WAEC Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<!-- Navigation -->\n  <nav class=\"sticky top-0 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-emerald-100 z-50\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/biology/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"mi -arrow-left\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>\n          <span>Back to Biology</span>\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">WAEC SSCE Biology</span>\n          <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium\">SS2-SS3</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"text-center mb-10\">\n      <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-4\">\n        <span class=\"mi -kidneys\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>\n        <span>Transport &amp; Excretion</span>\n      </div>\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Excretory Systems in Animals</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n        Understanding how animals remove metabolic waste products is essential for WAEC Biology. \n        Learn about the structures, mechanisms, and products of excretion across different organisms.\n      </p>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n    <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 mb-8 border border-emerald-100\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n          <span class=\"mi -bullseye text-emerald-600 text-xl\" data-mi=\"adjust\">adjust</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">By the end of this lesson, you should be able to:</p>\n          <ul class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n              <span class=\"text-gray-700\">Define excretion and explain its importance</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n              <span class=\"text-gray-700\">Identify excretory organs and their products</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n              <span class=\"text-gray-700\">Compare excretory systems in different organisms</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n              <span class=\"text-gray-700\">Explain the structure and function of the mammalian kidney</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n      <!-- Left Column - Main Content -->\n      <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 space-y-6\">\n        \n        <!-- Definition Section -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-emerald-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">1</span>\n            What is Excretion?\n          </h2>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-xl p-5 mb-5\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-800 mb-2\">Definition</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700\">\n              <strong>Excretion</strong> is the process by which metabolic waste products are removed from the body of an organism. \n              These waste products are produced during chemical reactions (metabolism) within cells and can be toxic if allowed to accumulate.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-5\">\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-4\">\n              <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"mi -flask mr-2\" data-mi=\"science\">science</span>Metabolic Wastes Include:\n              </h4>\n              <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-1\">\n                <li>• Carbon dioxide (CO₂)</li>\n                <li>• Water (H₂O)</li>\n                <li>• Urea</li>\n                <li>• Uric acid</li>\n                <li>• Ammonia</li>\n                <li>• Excess salts and minerals</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-amber-50 rounded-xl p-4\">\n              <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-amber-800 mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"mi -exclamation-triangle mr-2\" data-mi=\"warning_amber\">warning_amber</span>Why Excretion is Important:\n              </h4>\n              <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-1\">\n                <li>• Prevents toxic accumulation</li>\n                <li>• Maintains osmotic balance</li>\n                <li>• Regulates pH of body fluids</li>\n                <li>• Maintains homeostasis</li>\n                <li>• Prevents cell damage</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-400 p-4 rounded-r-xl\">\n            <p class=\"text-red-800 font-medium\">\n              <span class=\"mi -info-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"info\">info</span>\n              <strong>Note:</strong> Excretion is different from egestion. Egestion is the removal of undigested food from the digestive tract (faeces), while excretion removes metabolic wastes from cells.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Excretory Products Section -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-emerald-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">2</span>\n            Excretory Products and Organs\n          </h2>\n\n          <div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-6\">\n            <table class=\"w-full border-collapse\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr class=\"bg-emerald-100\">\n                  <th class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-emerald-800\">Excretory Product</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-emerald-800\">Organ</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-emerald-800\">Source/Origin</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Carbon dioxide (CO₂)</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Lungs</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Cellular respiration</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-emerald-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Urea</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Kidneys</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Deamination of amino acids in liver</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Uric acid</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Kidneys</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Breakdown of nucleic acids</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-emerald-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Water &amp; Salts</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Kidneys, Skin (sweat)</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Metabolic reactions, diet</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3 font-medium\">Bile pigments</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Liver</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-3\">Breakdown of haemoglobin</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Nitrogenous Wastes -->\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-5 mb-5\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-3\">\n              <span class=\"mi -atom mr-2\" data-mi=\"atom\">atom</span>Nitrogenous Waste Products\n            </h3>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">\n              Nitrogenous wastes are produced from the breakdown of proteins and nucleic acids. Different animals excrete nitrogen in different forms:\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n              <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-purple-200\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700 mb-2\">Ammonia (NH₃)</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Very toxic</li>\n                  <li>• Highly soluble in water</li>\n                  <li>• Requires lots of water</li>\n                  <li>• Excreted by aquatic animals</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-purple-200\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700 mb-2\">Urea</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Less toxic than ammonia</li>\n                  <li>• Moderately soluble</li>\n                  <li>• Requires less water</li>\n                  <li>• Excreted by mammals</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-purple-200\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700 mb-2\">Uric Acid</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Least toxic</li>\n                  <li>• Insoluble (paste form)</li>\n                  <li>• Requires minimal water</li>\n                  <li>• Excreted by birds, reptiles, insects</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- The Mammalian Kidney -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-emerald-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">3</span>\n            The Mammalian Kidney\n          </h2>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\">Structure of the Kidney</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">\n              Humans have two bean-shaped kidneys located on either side of the vertebral column, behind the abdominal cavity. \n              Each kidney weighs about 150g and is approximately 10-12cm long.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Kidney Structure Diagram -->\n          <div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-6\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 text-center\">Internal Structure of the Kidney</h4>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center mb-4\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" class=\"w-full max-w-md\">\n                <!-- Kidney outline -->\n                <ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"120\" ry=\"140\" fill=\"#f87171\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"3\"></ellipse>\n                \n                <!-- Cortex (outer region) -->\n                <ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"100\" ry=\"120\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"none\"></ellipse>\n                \n                <!-- Medulla (inner region with pyramids) -->\n                <ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"90\" fill=\"#ef4444\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse>\n                \n                <!-- Renal pyramids -->\n                <path d=\"M160 80 L180 150 L160 220\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M200 70 L200 150 L200 230\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M240 80 L220 150 L240 220\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n                \n                <!-- Pelvis -->\n                <path d=\"M200 180 Q200 220 180 250 L220 250 Q200 220 200 180\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n                \n                <!-- Ureter -->\n                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"250\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>\n                \n                <!-- Labels -->\n                <text x=\"320\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#374151\">Cortex</text>\n                <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>\n                \n                <text x=\"320\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#374151\">Medulla</text>\n                <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>\n                \n                <text x=\"320\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#374151\">Renal Pyramid</text>\n                <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"175\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>\n                \n                <text x=\"320\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#374151\">Renal Pelvis</text>\n                <line x1=\"210\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>\n                \n                <text x=\"230\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#374151\">Ureter</text>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Kidney Parts Accordion -->\n          <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n            <div class=\"border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\">\n              <button class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-emerald-50 flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-emerald-100 transition\">\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-800\">The Cortex (Outer Region)</span>\n                <span class=\"mi -chevron-down text-emerald-600 transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n              </button>\n              <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n                  <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-2\">\n                    <li>• <strong>Location:</strong> Outer dark-brown region of the kidney</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Contains:</strong> Bowman's capsules and convoluted tubules</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Function:</strong> Site of ultrafiltration where blood is filtered</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Appearance:</strong> Granular due to presence of glomeruli</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\">\n              <button class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-emerald-50 flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-emerald-100 transition\">\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-800\">The Medulla (Inner Region)</span>\n                <span class=\"mi -chevron-down text-emerald-600 transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n              </button>\n              <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n                  <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-2\">\n                    <li>• <strong>Location:</strong> Inner lighter-coloured region</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Contains:</strong> Loop of Henle and collecting ducts</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Structure:</strong> Made up of 8-18 renal pyramids</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Function:</strong> Site of water reabsorption and urine concentration</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\">\n              <button class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-emerald-50 flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-emerald-100 transition\">\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-800\">The Renal Pelvis</span>\n                <span class=\"mi -chevron-down text-emerald-600 transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n              </button>\n              <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n                  <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-2\">\n                    <li>• <strong>Location:</strong> Funnel-shaped cavity in the centre</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Function:</strong> Collects urine from collecting ducts</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Connection:</strong> Leads into the ureter</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Role:</strong> Acts as a reservoir before urine passes to ureter</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\">\n              <button class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-emerald-50 flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-emerald-100 transition\">\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-800\">The Nephron (Functional Unit)</span>\n                <span class=\"mi -chevron-down text-emerald-600 transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n              </button>\n              <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n                  <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">The nephron is the functional unit of the kidney. Each kidney contains about 1 million nephrons.</p>\n                  <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-2\">\n                    <li>• <strong>Bowman's Capsule:</strong> Cup-shaped structure containing glomerulus</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Proximal Convoluted Tubule:</strong> Highly coiled, site of reabsorption</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Loop of Henle:</strong> U-shaped loop for water conservation</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Distal Convoluted Tubule:</strong> Regulates ion concentration</li>\n                    <li>• <strong>Collecting Duct:</strong> Carries urine to pelvis, final water reabsorption</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Urine Formation -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-emerald-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">4</span>\n            Formation of Urine\n          </h2>\n\n          <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-6\">\n            Urine formation involves three main processes that occur in the nephron:\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"grid gap-4 mb-6\">\n            <!-- Ultrafiltration -->\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-5 border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full text-sm mr-2\">1</span>\n                Ultrafiltration\n              </h3>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n                Occurs in the glomerulus and Bowman's capsule. Blood pressure forces small molecules through the glomerular capillary walls into the Bowman's capsule.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-3\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-blue-700 mb-1\">Filtered into capsule:</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Water, glucose, amino acids, urea, salts, vitamins</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-3\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-blue-700 mb-1\">Not filtered (too large):</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Red blood cells, white blood cells, platelets, proteins</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Selective Reabsorption -->\n            <div class=\"bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-5 border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full text-sm mr-2\">2</span>\n                Selective Reabsorption\n              </h3>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n                Useful substances are reabsorbed back into the blood from the filtrate as it passes through the tubules.\n              </p>\n              <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                <li>• <strong>Proximal tubule:</strong> All glucose, amino acids, 65% of water and salts</li>\n                <li>• <strong>Loop of Henle:</strong> Water and sodium chloride</li>\n                <li>• <strong>Distal tubule:</strong> Water, sodium ions, bicarbonate ions</li>\n                <li>• <strong>Collecting duct:</strong> Water (controlled by ADH hormone)</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Tubular Secretion -->\n            <div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-5 border-l-4 border-purple-500\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full text-sm mr-2\">3</span>\n                Tubular Secretion\n              </h3>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n                Additional waste products are actively transported from blood into the tubules to be excreted.\n              </p>\n              <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                <li>• Hydrogen ions (H⁺) - for pH regulation</li>\n                <li>• Potassium ions (K⁺)</li>\n                <li>• Certain drugs and toxins</li>\n                <li>• Creatinine</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Composition of Urine -->\n          <div class=\"bg-amber-50 rounded-xl p-5\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-amber-800 mb-3\">\n              <span class=\"mi -flask mr-2\" data-mi=\"science\">science</span>Composition of Normal Urine\n            </h3>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              <div>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-amber-700 mb-2\">Main Components:</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Water: 95-96%</li>\n                  <li>• Urea: 2%</li>\n                  <li>• Sodium chloride: 1%</li>\n                  <li>• Other salts: 0.5%</li>\n                  <li>• Uric acid and creatinine: trace amounts</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-amber-700 mb-2\">Characteristics:</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Colour: Pale yellow (due to urochrome)</li>\n                  <li>• Odour: Slightly aromatic</li>\n                  <li>• pH: Slightly acidic (6.0)</li>\n                  <li>• Specific gravity: 1.010-1.030</li>\n                  <li>• Should NOT contain: glucose, proteins, blood</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Comparison of Excretory Systems -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-emerald-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">5</span>\n            Comparison of Excretory Systems\n          </h2>\n\n          <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n            <table class=\"w-full border-collapse\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr class=\"bg-emerald-100\">\n                  <th class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-emerald-800\">Organism</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-emerald-800\">Excretory Organ</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-emerald-800\">Main Waste</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-emerald-800\">Key Features</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Amoeba</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Contractile vacuole</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Ammonia + excess water</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Simple, osmoregulation</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-emerald-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Flatworms</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Flame cells</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Ammonia</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Network of tubules</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Earthworm</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Nephridia</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Ammonia + urea</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Pairs in each segment</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-emerald-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Insects</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Malpighian tubules</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Uric acid</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Water conservation</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Fish (freshwater)</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Kidneys + gills</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Ammonia</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Produce dilute urine</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-emerald-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Mammals</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Kidneys + lungs + skin</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Urea + CO₂</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Concentrated urine</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Birds/Reptiles</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Kidneys</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Uric acid</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-2\">Semi-solid waste, water-saving</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Worked Examples -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-emerald-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">6</span>\n            Worked Examples\n          </h2>\n\n          <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n            <!-- Example 1 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm font-medium\">WAEC 2019</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm\">Theory Question</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium mb-3\">\n                Explain why a person suffering from kidney failure may need dialysis treatment.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200\">\n                <p class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-700 mb-2\">Solution:</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-2\">\n                  <li>1. The kidneys filter blood to remove metabolic waste products like urea, excess salts, and water.</li>\n                  <li>2. In kidney failure, these waste products accumulate in the blood to toxic levels.</li>\n                  <li>3. Dialysis is an artificial method that performs the function of the kidneys.</li>\n                  <li>4. In dialysis, blood is passed through a dialysis machine with a semi-permeable membrane.</li>\n                  <li>5. Waste products diffuse from the blood (high concentration) into the dialysis fluid (low concentration).</li>\n                  <li>6. Essential substances like glucose remain in the blood due to their absence in the dialysis fluid.</li>\n                  <li>7. The cleaned blood is returned to the body, preventing toxic accumulation.</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Example 2 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm font-medium\">WAEC 2021</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm\">Theory Question</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium mb-3\">\n                State three differences between excretion and egestion.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200 overflow-x-auto\">\n                <p class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-700 mb-2\">Solution:</p>\n                <table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\n                  <thead>\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-300\">\n                      <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-2\">Excretion</th>\n                      <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-2\">Egestion</th>\n                    </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Removes metabolic waste products from cells</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Removes undigested food from the digestive tract</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Products include urea, CO₂, excess water</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Product is faeces</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Occurs in all living cells</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Occurs only in the digestive system</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Materials were never part of the body</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Materials passed through but never entered cells</td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right Column - Sidebar -->\n      <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n        \n        <!-- Video Resource -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden border border-emerald-100\">\n          <div class=\"bg-emerald-500 text-white px-4 py-3\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -play-circle\" data-mi=\"play_circle\">play_circle</span>\n              Video Lesson\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"aspect-video\">\n            <iframe class=\"w-full h-full\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yX5f3hJfD6I\" title=\"Excretory System\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\">\n            </iframe>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-4\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">\n              <span class=\"mi -info-circle text-emerald-500 mr-1\" data-mi=\"info\">info</span>\n              This video explains the structure and function of the human excretory system.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Key Terms -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-5 border border-emerald-100\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"mi -book text-emerald-500\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span>\n            Key Terms to Remember\n          </h3>\n          <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-emerald-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">Deamination</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Removal of amino group from amino acids in the liver</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-emerald-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">Glomerulus</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Network of capillaries in Bowman's capsule</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-emerald-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">Ultrafiltration</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Filtration under pressure through tiny pores</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-emerald-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">Osmoregulation</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Control of water balance in the body</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-emerald-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">ADH (Antidiuretic Hormone)</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Hormone that controls water reabsorption</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Quick Quiz -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-5 border border-emerald-100\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"mi -question-circle text-emerald-500\" data-mi=\"help\">help</span>\n            Quick Quiz\n          </h3>\n          <div id=\"quiz-container\" data-bidemy=\"quiz\">\n            <div class=\"quiz-question mb-4\" data-question=\"1\">\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium mb-3\">1. The main excretory product in mammals is:</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  A. Ammonia\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  B. Urea\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  C. Uric acid\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  D. Creatinine\n                </button>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"feedback-q1\" class=\"mt-2 hidden\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"quiz-question mb-4\" data-question=\"2\">\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium mb-3\">2. Ultrafiltration occurs in the:</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  A. Loop of Henle\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  B. Distal tubule\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  C. Glomerulus and Bowman's capsule\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  D. Collecting duct\n                </button>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"feedback-q2\" class=\"mt-2 hidden\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-question=\"3\">\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium mb-3\">3. Which organism excretes uric acid?</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  A. Fish\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  B. Bird\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  C. Mammal\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition\">\n                  D. Amoeba\n                </button>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"feedback-q3\" class=\"mt-2 hidden\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"mt-4 w-full bg-emerald-500 text-white py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-600 transition font-medium\">\n            Check Answers\n          </button>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WAEC Exam Tips -->\n        <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-5 border border-amber-200\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-amber-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"mi -lightbulb text-amber-500\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span>\n            WAEC Exam Tips\n          </h3>\n          <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-2 text-sm\">\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check text-amber-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n              <span>Know the difference between excretion and egestion</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check text-amber-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n              <span>Be able to label diagrams of the kidney and nephron</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check text-amber-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n              <span>Understand the three stages of urine formation</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check text-amber-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n              <span>Compare excretory systems across different organisms</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check text-amber-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n              <span>Link excretion to homeostasis and osmoregulation</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 py-6 mt-12\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n      <p class=\"text-sm\">WAEC SSCE Biology Study Material | Excretory Systems</p>\n      <p class=\"text-xs mt-2 text-gray-500\">© 2024 Educational Platform. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  \n\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-white to-teal-50 min-h-screen","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n    .accordion-content { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out; }\n    .accordion-content.open { max-height: 2000px; }\n    .quiz-option:hover { transform: translateX(4px); }\n    .quiz-option.selected { background: #dbeafe; border-color: #3b82f6; }\n    .quiz-option.correct { background: #dcfce7; border-color: #22c55e; }\n    .quiz-option.incorrect { background: #fee2e2; border-color: #ef4444; }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}